# Optional: only for login modes (likes, followers, following, tagged, stories,
# highlights, search, location) and for deeper comments/hashtag pagination.
# Paste a cookie export JSON, a bare sessionid value, or a "name=value; ..." string.
INSTAGRAM_SESSION_COOKIE=
